 "structural_change": "the flat 8-bank tile dsfd_vm_bgr (63,416 sinks on one root, 5,441 feed-through bits over an 8-macro column, GRT 20,000 markers) is replaced by 8 identical one-bank hard leaves dsfd_vm_bgl28, every N/S bit registered at both pin faces (leaf hop 2), one SRAM and one clock root of ~14.5k sinks a leaf, under a wires-only parent || r2: hardened parent with a 21.6 um W strap column (bank-index ties + clock spine buffers; coordinator 2026-10-13 12:45), 8 abutted 345.6 x 90.72 leaves at x 21.6, outline 367.2 x 725.76",
 "why_floorplan": "wires-only parent of 8 abutted one-bank leaves (8 x 90.72 = 725.76) E of a 21.6 um strap column: the N/S buses connect by abutment at the same x / layer per bit; the parent's own nets are ck / rs / grp (W pins -> the leaves' W-face pins across the strap column) and the 3-bit bank-index ties, all in the strap column",
 "open_points": [
  "leaf hop 2 kept in this build: +40 cycles per VM read stream = 1.38 % (field phases) .. 4.10 % (field + SU) AR tok/s by the throughput stream's count (el1013-rom-layer-tput-s81.log 12:36), UNMEASURED in RTL; hop 1 / stream prefetch in the VM master is the follow-up (rtl_change re-route of the leaf, same outline)",
